# As assume-method-before-type.moss, and g calls x.m() (AUDIT-CHANGES #59).
# Audit before: rejects (T.m is filed at the nominal TNom T [], not at x's
# type T, so no method m is in force at x's receiver; argued). Audit now:
# rejects (the assume list does not form; argued).
# Oracle (moss_m2): rejects ("type `T` is not available in the context here").
# Native (ob-family moss, seed 1h1710x0): rejects ("no matching method is
